mutability.bas:4:1: a is a let: it can't change
  a = 2
  ^
mutability.bas:6:1: C is a const: it can't change
  C += 1
  ^
mutability.bas:8:5: n is a parameter: make it mut to change it
      n = 1
      ^
mutability.bas:11:5: i is the loop's counter: it can't change
      i = 5
      ^
mutability.bas:16:3: n is mut: write mut before it
  g(v)
    ^
mutability.bas:17:7: a is a let: it can't change
  g(mut a)
        ^
mutability.bas:18:7: mut takes a var
  g(mut 1 + 2)
        ^
mutability.bas:19:3: n is not mut
  f(mut v)
    ^
mutability.bas:22:10: v is lent mut in this call
  h(mut v, v)
           ^
mutability.bas:24:7: mut n is an int, not a double
  g(mut d)
        ^
